00:00:39.225 --> 00:00:41.414
AND I UNDERSTAND THE HISTORY OF

00:00:41.415 --> 00:00:43.336
RASUL TO RACIAL JUSTICE IN THE

00:00:43.337 --> 00:00:44.611
COUNTRY AND WHY THE
AFRICAN-AMERICAN OR AT LEAST

00:00:44.645 --> 00:00:46.137
AFRICAN-AMERICAN OR AT LEAST

00:00:46.139 --> 00:00:51.479
SOME OF IT WOULD VIEW THE EVENTS

00:00:51.513 --> 00:00:53.351
AS MANIFEST TO IT --

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:54.361
MANIFESTATIONS OF THE POLICE

00:00:54.363 --> 00:00:54.908
DEPARTMENTS.

00:00:54.942 --> 00:00:57.031
BUT I THINK IN FACT THE PAST 50

00:00:57.064 --> 00:00:58.953
OR 60 YEARS WE HAD A LOT OF

00:00:58.955 --> 00:00:59.729
REFORM FROM THE POLICE

00:00:59.731 --> 00:01:00.259
DEPARTMENT.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.440
I WAS ATTORNEY GENERAL AND I CAN

00:01:02.441 --> 00:01:05.027
TELL YOU THERE IS A WORLD OF

00:01:05.061 --> 00:01:06.583
DIFFERENCE, TODAY THE POLICE

00:01:06.584 --> 00:01:09.534
CHIEF UNDERSTAND THE NEED FOR

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:12.194
CHANGE AND THERE HAS BEEN GREAT

00:01:12.228 --> 00:01:14.855
CHANGE AND I THINK DEFUNDING THE

00:01:14.856 --> 00:01:15.981
POLICE, HOLDING THE ENTIRE

00:01:15.982 --> 00:01:17.723
POLICE STRUCTURE RESPONSIBLE FOR

00:01:17.758 --> 00:01:18.970
THE ACTIONS OF CERTAIN OFFICERS

00:01:18.971 --> 00:01:20.041
IS WRONG.

00:01:20.042 --> 00:01:22.119
AND I THINK IT IS DANGEROUS TO

00:01:22.121 --> 00:01:22.603
DEMONIZE POLICE.

00:01:22.604 --> 00:01:25.103
&gt;&gt; Bret: SO HOW DO THESE BAD

00:01:25.104 --> 00:01:26.879
COPS COME IF YOU WANT TO CALL

00:01:26.914 --> 00:01:28.981
THEM THAT GET THROUGH IN THE

00:01:28.982 --> 00:01:29.727
SYSTEMS?

00:01:29.761 --> 00:01:31.537
DO YOU BLAME POLICE UNIONS?

00:01:31.539 --> 00:01:33.609
DO YOU BLAME THE SYSTEMS

00:01:33.644 --> 00:01:35.172
THEMSELVES FOR NOT WAITING THEM

00:01:35.207 --> 00:01:35.996
OUT?

00:01:35.997 --> 00:01:39.867
HOW DO YOU ADDRESS WHAT IS

00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:40.904
FRUSTRATION AND ANGER?

00:01:40.905 --> 00:01:42.015
&gt;&gt; Attorney General Barr: NOT

00:01:42.016 --> 00:01:43.806
REFERRING TO ANY PARTICULAR CASE

00:01:43.807 --> 00:01:46.859
BUT YOU HAVE TO REMEMBER IT IS A

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:47.601
NONMONOLITHIC SYSTEM.

00:01:47.635 --> 00:01:49.104
THERE ARE 900,000 POLICE

00:01:49.139 --> 00:01:51.869
OFFICERS IN THE UNITED STATES.

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:54.809
AND RIGHT NOW, THERE IS A CRISIS

00:01:54.844 --> 00:01:56.445
IN POLICING BECAUSE IT IS A

00:01:56.479 --> 00:01:57.748
TOUGH JOB.

00:01:57.749 --> 00:02:00.006
WHAT WE HAD BEFORE COVID, FULL

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.525
COVID ECONOMY.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:04.103
AND WE’VE HAD TROUBLE ATTRACTING

00:02:04.138 --> 00:02:05.762
PEOPLE AND RETAINING PEOPLE AS

00:02:05.763 --> 00:02:06.695
POLICE OFFICERS.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.618
WE WANT THE BEST, MOST

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.470
RESPONSIBLE PEOPLE WE CAN GET.

00:02:10.471 --> 00:02:12.736
WE HAVE TO ATTRACT THEM INTO THE

00:02:12.771 --> 00:02:13.460
PROFESSION.

00:02:13.494 --> 00:02:15.792
WE HAVE TO TRAIN THEM.

00:02:15.793 --> 00:02:17.883
AND WE HAVE TO CONTINUE TO

00:02:17.884 --> 00:02:18.903
PROFESSIONALIZE THE POLICE

00:02:18.904 --> 00:02:19.894
FORCES.

00:02:19.895 --> 00:02:22.099
WE HAVE GENERALLY SPEAKING

00:02:22.101 --> 00:02:24.249
EXCELLENT POLICE FORCES IN THE

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:24.901
UNITED STATES.

00:02:24.902 --> 00:02:26.711
NONE OF US AS INDIVIDUALS WANT

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:28.264
TO BE LUMPED TOGETHER.

00:02:28.266 --> 00:02:30.331
WE WANT TO BE JUDGED BY WHAT WE

00:02:30.332 --> 00:02:31.743
DO AS INDIVIDUALS.

00:02:31.744 --> 00:02:33.004
WE DON’T WANT MISCONDUCT OF

00:02:33.038 --> 00:02:35.433
OTHERS ATTRIBUTED TO US.

00:02:35.467 --> 00:02:38.065
THAT IS IN EVERY WALK OF LIFE.

00:02:38.066 --> 00:02:40.037
ONE OF THE LEGITIMATE GRIEVANCES

00:02:40.038 --> 00:02:41.815
OF THE AFRICAN-AMERICAN

00:02:41.817 --> 00:02:44.304
COMMUNITY, THEY ARE TREATED WITH

00:02:44.305 --> 00:02:46.019
SUSPICION AND EMBRACED AS

00:02:46.021 --> 00:02:47.493
AFRICAN-AMERICANS.

00:02:47.494 --> 00:02:49.030
THAT DOES HAPPEN.

00:02:49.064 --> 00:02:50.814
BY THE SAME TOKEN, PEACEFUL

00:02:50.848 --> 00:02:51.961
WOMEN’S TRADER SHOULD NOT BE

00:02:51.962 --> 00:02:52.626
TREATED AS VIOLENT EXTREMIST

00:02:52.627 --> 00:02:53.913
BECAUSE SIMPLY OUT ON THE

00:02:53.914 --> 00:02:54.396
STREETS.

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:57.149
THAT IS THE SAME WITH POLICE

00:02:57.183 --> 00:02:57.715
OFFICERS.

00:02:57.716 --> 00:02:58.854
EVERY ORGANIZATION HAS

00:02:58.855 --> 00:02:59.975
INDIVIDUALS ENGAGING IN THIS

00:02:59.976 --> 00:03:02.641
CONDUCT, AND WE HAVE TO BE

00:03:02.642 --> 00:03:04.012
CAREFUL BEFORE WE SAY ALL

00:03:04.046 --> 00:03:04.397
ORGANIZATIONS.

00:03:04.398 --> 00:03:07.922
&gt;&gt; Bret: WHAT WOULD HAPPEN IF

00:03:07.956 --> 00:03:09.862
A MAJOR AMERICAN CITY, CHICAGO,

00:03:09.863 --> 00:03:10.896
D.C. DISBAND ITS POLICE

00:03:10.897 --> 00:03:11.205
DEPARTMENT?

00:03:11.239 --> 00:03:13.266
WHAT WOULD THAT LOOK LIKE?

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.494
WITH THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT HAVE

00:03:14.528 --> 00:03:15.987
TO STEP DOWN?

00:03:16.022 --> 00:03:18.641
&gt;&gt; Attorney General Barr: WHAT

00:03:18.675 --> 00:03:20.065
IT WOULD LOOK LIKE IS

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.168
VENTILATED -- VENTILATED IN

00:03:21.169 --> 00:03:22.904
SHIISM AND CHAOS IN THE CITY.

00:03:22.905 --> 00:03:25.818
AND THAT IS WHY DOING THINGS

00:03:25.819 --> 00:03:27.402
THAT PREVENT US FROM HAVING A

00:03:27.436 --> 00:03:28.798
STRONG EFFECT OF POLICE FORCE

00:03:28.799 --> 00:03:29.505
ARE COUNTERPRODUCTIVE.

00:03:29.539 --> 00:03:31.429
YOU HAVE MORE KILLINGS.

00:03:31.431 --> 00:03:33.015
THAT’S BEEN SHOWN TIME AND TIME

00:03:33.017 --> 00:03:33.558
AGAIN.

00:03:33.592 --> 00:03:36.071
&gt;&gt; Bret: A MAJOR AMERICAN CITY

00:03:36.106 --> 00:03:37.591
DOING THAT WOULD BE DANGEROUS.

00:03:37.593 --> 00:03:38.635
&gt;&gt; Attorney General Barr:

00:03:38.636 --> 00:03:40.420
ABSOLUTELY, WE HAVE TO PUT

00:03:40.421 --> 00:03:41.332
THINGS IN PERSPECTIVE,

00:03:41.366 --> 00:03:41.587
OBVIOUSLY.

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:43.179
WHEN POLICE USE EXCESSIVE FORCE

00:03:43.181 --> 00:03:44.889
THEY HAVE TO BE HELD

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:45.281
ACCOUNTABLE.

00:03:45.282 --> 00:03:46.813
THE STATE AND FEDERAL GOVERNMENT

00:03:46.847 --> 00:03:48.314
ZOOMED IN AND IMMEDIATELY TOOK

00:03:48.348 --> 00:03:49.247
UP THE MATTER.

00:03:49.249 --> 00:03:52.061
THERE IS NO QUESTION IT IS AN

00:03:52.062 --> 00:03:53.614
ISSUE AND HAS TO BE DEALT WITH

00:03:53.616 --> 00:03:55.786
PATENT TERMS OF SHEER NUMBERS,

00:03:55.787 --> 00:03:58.215
THE POLICE OFFICERS WHO ARE

00:03:58.249 --> 00:03:59.543
PRESSING AFRICAN-AMERICAN

00:03:59.577 --> 00:04:00.065
COMMUNITIES.

00:04:00.066 --> 00:04:01.951
THERE ARE A LOT MORE DAMAGE FROM

00:04:01.986 --> 00:04:04.258
A LOT MORE KILLING COME A LOT

00:04:04.293 --> 00:04:06.409
MORE FEAR IN GENERAL ON THE

00:04:06.411 --> 00:04:08.425
STREETS FROM CRIMINAL ELEMENTS.

00:04:08.426 --> 00:04:10.837
FOR CHICAGO, FOR EXAMPLE 50

00:04:10.838 --> 00:04:12.058
PEOPLE SHOT.

00:04:12.059 --> 00:04:14.107
IF YOU PULLED BACK THE POLICE

00:04:14.108 --> 00:04:15.663
FROM THESE COMMUNITIES, THEY

00:04:15.665 --> 00:04:18.147
WILL BE MORE HARM DONE TO THE

00:04:18.182 --> 00:04:18.726
COMMUNITIES.

00:04:18.761 --> 00:04:21.363
THE PRESIDENT, YOU KNOW HAS BEEN

00:04:21.364 --> 00:04:23.854
ATTEMPTING TO ADDRESS THE

00:04:23.856 --> 00:04:24.892
CRIMINAL JUSTICE REFORM ISSUE.

00:04:24.894 --> 00:04:28.365
HE TOOK THE FIRST STEP ACT AND

00:04:28.366 --> 00:04:29.736
SET UP THE POLICE SINCE

00:04:29.771 --> 00:04:31.717
LYNDON JOHNSON AND LOOKING FOR

00:04:31.752 --> 00:04:32.800
SITES WITH THESE ISSUES AND

00:04:32.835 --> 00:04:34.757
COMING OUT SHORTLY BUT THE

00:04:34.758 --> 00:04:37.371
PROPOSALS ON THIS.

00:04:37.406 --> 00:04:40.102
AND HE’S ALSO ADVANCED

00:04:40.103 --> 00:04:41.656
OPPORTUNITY ZONES IN THE

00:04:41.657 --> 00:04:42.417
INNER-CITY.

00:04:42.418 --> 00:04:44.353
HE’S PUSHING FOR SCHOOL CHOICE

00:04:44.354 --> 00:04:46.002
FOR INNER-CITY PARENTS THAT TO

00:04:46.003 --> 00:04:48.561
ME AS A CIVIL RIGHTS ISSUE OF

00:04:48.563 --> 00:04:50.301
THE ERA IS GIVING THE PARENTS

00:04:50.302 --> 00:04:51.663
