00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:55.966
HE IS ADDRESSING THAT.

00:04:56.001 --> 00:04:57.589
PULLING THE POLICE BACK FROM

00:04:57.624 --> 00:04:59.776
THESE COMMUNITIES WOULD MAKE IT

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.996
FAR MORE DIFFICULT FOR THESE

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.678
COMMUNITIES TO HAVE THE EQUAL

00:05:03.679 --> 00:05:04.923
