00:05:07.191 --> 00:05:09.399
&gt;&gt; Bret: AS YOU KNOW, THERE IS

00:05:09.433 --> 00:05:11.292
A HOUSE BILL AND EFFORT FOR

00:05:11.327 --> 00:05:12.352
POLICE REPORT FORM FROM CONGRESS

00:05:12.353 --> 00:05:13.976
