00:05:16.961 --> 00:05:17.892
AND NATIONAL MISCONDUCT REGISTRY

00:05:17.926 --> 00:05:18.927
FOR THE POLICE.

00:05:18.961 --> 00:05:20.235
&gt;&gt; Attorney General Barr: I

00:05:20.237 --> 00:05:22.340
