00:05:22.341 --> 00:05:23.842
SO I’M NOT EXACTLY SURE.

00:05:23.844 --> 00:05:26.774
ON THE ISSUES OF THOSE BUT ISSUE

00:05:26.809 --> 00:05:28.990
BY ISSUE, THERE IS A PRUDENT

00:05:28.991 --> 00:05:31.819
BALANCE TO BE STRUCK BETWEEN

00:05:31.821 --> 00:05:34.198
MAKING SURE, ACCOUNTABLE.

00:05:34.199 --> 00:05:37.380
POLICE IS NOT LIKE SITTING IN AN

00:05:37.381 --> 00:05:38.087
OFFICE.

00:05:38.088 --> 00:05:40.666
WE PUT THESE INDIVIDUALS INTO A

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:41.618
HIGHLY CHARGED, DANGEROUS

00:05:41.619 --> 00:05:43.068
SITUATIONS WHERE THEIR OWN LIFE

00:05:43.102 --> 00:05:44.075
IS AT STAKE.

00:05:44.076 --> 00:05:45.103
THEY DRILL IN ADRENALINE IS

00:05:45.105 --> 00:05:45.999
PUMPING AND SO FORTH.

00:05:46.033 --> 00:05:49.220
WE HAVE TO MAKE SURE WE TREAT

00:05:49.221 --> 00:05:51.405
THEM FAIRLY IN THOSE TIMES OF

00:05:51.407 --> 00:05:51.615
CIRCUMSTANCES.

00:05:51.649 --> 00:05:52.464
&gt;&gt; Bret: PANNING CHOKE HOLD?

00:05:52.499 --> 00:05:54.293
&gt;&gt; Attorney General Barr: I

00:05:54.294 --> 00:05:55.592
THINK WE SHOULD BAN LATERAL

00:05:55.627 --> 00:05:57.308
