00:05:57.342 --> 00:06:00.228
NECESSARY TO MEET LETHAL -- AND

00:06:00.229 --> 00:06:01.692
LIST POLICE ARE CONFRONTED WITH

00:06:01.694 --> 00:06:03.297
POTENTIAL LETHAL FORCE.

00:06:03.331 --> 00:06:05.426
I THINK THERE IS A GENERAL

00:06:05.427 --> 00:06:06.878
AGREEMENT AMONG POLICE AGENCIES

00:06:06.912 --> 00:06:08.851
WE NEED CLEARER STANDARDS.

00:06:08.853 --> 00:06:10.622
WE HAVE TO MAKE SURE THOSE

00:06:10.623 --> 00:06:11.835
STANDARDS ARE CLAIMED TO WE HAVE

00:06:11.837 --> 00:06:14.020
TO MAKE SURE THEY WERE SYSTEMS

00:06:14.055 --> 00:06:15.497
IN PLACE TO HOLD OFFICERS

00:06:15.499 --> 00:06:16.054
ACCOUNTABLE.

00:06:16.056 --> 00:06:17.511
I THINK THERE IS UNIVERSAL

00:06:17.512 --> 00:06:19.080
AGREEMENT ON THAT.

00:06:19.082 --> 00:06:21.700
&gt;&gt; Bret: IS THAT A FEDERAL

00:06:21.734 --> 00:06:22.028
EFFORT?

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.254
A FEDERAL TRAINING EFFORTS?

00:06:23.255 --> 00:06:24.930
&gt;&gt; Attorney General Barr: I

00:06:24.965 --> 00:06:27.020
THINK WE NEED A FEDERAL, STRONG

00:06:27.054 --> 00:06:28.446
PARTICIPATION IN THE EFFORT TO

00:06:28.448 --> 00:06:29.858
SET STANDARDS.

00:06:29.859 --> 00:06:33.538
&gt;&gt; Bret: A LOT OF TALK ABOUT

00:06:33.572 --> 00:06:35.450
MONDAY RELIVING THE MOMENT AT

00:06:35.484 --> 00:06:36.204
LAFAYETTE PARK.

00:06:36.206 --> 00:06:39.692
IF YOU HAD TO DO MONDAY OVER

00:06:39.693 --> 00:06:41.124
AGAIN, WOULD YOU DO SOMETHING

00:06:41.159 --> 00:06:41.385
DIFFERENT?

00:06:41.419 --> 00:06:43.030
&gt;&gt; Attorney General Barr:

00:06:43.031 --> 00:06:46.003
BASED ON WHAT I KNOW NOW, NO.

00:06:46.037 --> 00:06:48.054
MONDAY, WE WERE REACTING TO

00:06:48.055 --> 00:06:49.562
THREE DAYS OF EXTREMELY VIOLENT

00:06:49.596 --> 00:06:50.659
DEMONSTRATIONS.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:55.691
RIGHT ACROSS FROM A LOT OF

00:06:55.692 --> 00:06:58.507
INJURIES TO THE POLICE OFFICERS,

00:06:58.508 --> 00:06:59.050
ARSON.

00:06:59.084 --> 00:07:00.579
THINGS WERE SO BAD THE

00:07:00.581 --> 00:07:01.572
SECRET SERVICE SECRET SERVICE

00:07:01.573 --> 00:07:02.899
RECOMMENDED DOWN IN THE BUNKER

00:07:02.933 --> 00:07:04.866
AND WE CAN’T HAVE THAT IN OUR

00:07:04.868 --> 00:07:06.958
PUNKER SO THE DECISION WAS MADE.

00:07:06.993 --> 00:07:09.075
WE HAD TO MOVE THE PERIMETER ONE

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.376
BLOCK AND THAT IS WHAT WE ARE

00:07:10.378 --> 00:07:10.584
DOING.

00:07:10.585 --> 00:07:12.388
&gt;&gt; Bret: DID THE PRESIDENT

00:07:12.389 --> 00:07:14.706
