00:07:15.806 --> 00:07:17.477
&gt;&gt; AG Barr: HE DIDN’T TELL ME.

00:07:17.511 --> 00:07:19.477
I FOUND OUT LATER IN THE

00:07:19.512 --> 00:07:20.684
AFTERNOON HE MIGHT GO OUTSIDE OF

00:07:20.685 --> 00:07:21.482
