00:07:21.483 --> 00:07:23.397
BUT LIKE I SAID THE DECISION TO

00:07:23.398 --> 00:07:24.897
MOVE OUTSIDE OF THE PERIMETER

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:27.311
WAS MADE SUNDAY NIGHT BY THE

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:28.703
