00:07:28.704 --> 00:07:28.991
HOURS.

00:07:29.025 --> 00:07:31.635
ON MONDAY WHEN I ARRIVED, I

00:07:31.636 --> 00:07:33.332
AGREED WITH THE GENERAL OF

00:07:33.367 --> 00:07:34.300
CONCEPTION TO MOVE THE

00:07:34.301 --> 00:07:38.075
PARAMETERS TO FORTIFY A SENSE OF

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:40.643
A STRONGER FENCING AND SO FORTH,

00:07:40.644 --> 00:07:44.022
LAFAYETTE PARK, AND ALSO GIVE

00:07:44.023 --> 00:07:45.763
SOME BREATHING SPACE.

00:07:45.764 --> 00:07:49.004
IN THAT DECISION WAS SETTING AND

00:07:49.038 --> 00:07:50.794
EXECUTION AT 2:00 WITH ALL THE

00:07:50.795 --> 00:07:51.452
POLICE TACTICAL CHIEFS.

00:07:51.486 --> 00:07:53.207
&gt;&gt; Bret: BUT I MEAN SEEING

00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:55.255
WHAT HAS COME FROM IT IN THE

00:07:55.289 --> 00:07:57.886
IMAGE THAT HAS AT LEAST BEEN

00:07:57.921 --> 00:07:59.584
PERCEIVED, YOU WOULDN’T DO IT

00:07:59.585 --> 00:08:00.168
DIFFERENT?

00:08:00.169 --> 00:08:02.532
&gt;&gt; AG Barr: THE IMAGE HAS

00:08:02.533 --> 00:08:03.955
SOMEWHAT BEEN CREATED AND

00:08:03.956 --> 00:08:05.776
MISCREATED IN A SENSE THAT I

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.638
HAVEN’T SEEN ANY VIDEOS ON TV OF

00:08:08.639 --> 00:08:10.348
ALL THE VIOLENCE THAT WAS

00:08:10.349 --> 00:08:11.205
HAPPENING PRECEDING THAT.

00:08:11.207 --> 00:08:12.376
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU WERE HIT OR

00:08:12.377 --> 00:08:13.573
SOMETHING WAS THROWN AT YOU?

00:08:13.608 --> 00:08:18.125
&gt;&gt; AG Barr: I DID GO TO THE

00:08:18.126 --> 00:08:20.935
PARK BEFORE THE ACTUAL OPERATION

00:08:20.936 --> 00:08:22.796
TO MOVE OUT THE PERIMETER.

